json/list
description: Comma-separated list of values, enclosed into square brackets
- >
  A **list** (array) is an ordered sequence of values, enclosed into square brackets and separated
  by commas. Elements are addressed by position and need not share a shape:
- !!<format: text/x-json> |
  [1, "two", [3], {"four": 4}, null]
- >
  An element can be ANY JSON value — the grammar recurses here:
- *..:..
